nodes.body:
@ispobock, could you review the opt-in partial eviction of device-only FULL radix leaves and shepherd it to merge once the required reviews and CI checks pass? Please enable the required `run-ci` checks for `0fe6e0d1df4f`. This head includes the measured upstream baseline and its fix for the inherited lint failure.

Both C24 replays freed fewer D tokens, averaging a 22.2% reduction versus the controls. Mean TTFT improved, but P95 TTFT increased and Output TPS fell in both runs. The option defaults to zero. [Hardware evidence](https://github.com/INBreezefall/sglang/tree/26bc7bdac9a4158319a7d3d8e3cd10218072bb05/benchmark/ascend_a2_pd_evidence/c24).

